OL,3,GNEWSABrother of Kriss Donald killers in
OL,4,Agang who duped pensioners out of
OL,5,A#600,000
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe brother of two of Kriss Donald's
OL,8,Fkillers has admitted being part of a
OL,9,Fgang who duped 60 pensioners out of
OL,10,F#600,000.
OL,12,FThe High Court in Glasgow heard how
OL,13,FAhsan Shahid and two other men posed as
OL,14,Fpolice officers or bank investigators
OL,15,Fto con victims.
OL,17,FHis brothers Imran and Zeeshan Shahid
OL,18,Fwere jailed in 2006 for killing
OL,19,F15-year-old schoolboy Kriss Donald two
OL,20,Fyears earlier by stabbing him and
OL,21,Fsetting him on fire because he was
OL,22,Fwhite.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
